INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Pama-Lee/Ordo/ordo-rule-development', 'ordo-rule-development', 'Pama-Lee', 'Ordo', 'community', 'ordo-rule-development Pama-Lee Ordo community engine finance high-performance ordo rule rule-engine rules-engine rust security The ordo-rule-development skill provides a high-performance rule engine built in Rust, benefiting developers in finance and security. It utilizes a Step Flow model for conditional judgments and actions. ordo-rule-development 是一个高性能的规则引擎，基于 Rust 构建。它采用 Step Flow 模型来组织规则 ordo-rule-development は、Rust で構築された高性能のルールエンジンです。Step Flow モデルを使用してルールを組織します ordo-rule-development는 러스트(Rust)로 구축된 하이퍼포먼스 규칙 엔진입니다. 스텝 플로우 모델을 사용하여 규칙을 조직합니다 Ordo es un motor de reglas de alto rendimiento construido en Rust, que utiliza el modelo de flujo de paso para organizar reglas Ordo est un moteur de règles haute performance construit en Rust, qui utilise le modèle de flux de pas pour organiser les règles Ordo ist ein Hochleistungs-Regel-Engine, der in Rust erstellt wurde und das Schrittflussmodell verwendet, um Regeln zu organisieren O Ordo Rule Development é um motor de regras de alto desempenho em Rust, projetado para organizar regras com base no modelo de fluxo de etapas. ИИ Агенты с Ordo Rule Engine на Rust - это высокопроизводительный движок правил, предназначенный для организации правил на основе модели потока шагов. محرك قواعد أوردو باللغة روست هو محرك قواعد عالي الأداء مصمم لتنظيم القواعد على أساس نموذج تدفق الخطوات how to use ordo-rule-development ordo-rule-development alternative ordo-rule-development setup guide what is ordo-rule-development ordo-rule-development vs drools ordo-rule-development install ordo-rule-development for finance ordo-rule-development for security high-performance rule engine Rust-based rule engine ordo-rule-development 高性能规则引擎 Rust 规则引擎 Step Flow 模型 规则集结构 AI 工具 规则引擎开发 Utilizes Step Flow model with Decision Step, Action Step, and Terminal Step Supports creation of RuleSet structures using ordo_core::prelude::* Allows addition of steps to RuleSet using ruleset.ad Executes actions using set variables and calls to external services Terminates execution and returns results using Terminal Step Built using Rust for high-performance and reliability ordo-rule-development is a high-performance rule engine built in Rust, utilizing a Step Flow model for organizing rules and executing actions.');
