-Step","быстрые руководства для ACE-Step","музыка, генерируемая ИИ","технологии музыки ИИ"],"ar":["ACE-Step","إنشاء موسيقى باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الموسيقى الاصطناعية","تطوير الموسيقى باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","دلائل إعداد ACE-Step","وثائق ACE-Step","دلائل البدء السريع ل ACE-Step","الموسيقى المنشأة بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تقنيات الموسيقى الاصطناعية"]}},"owner":"diskrotrepo","repo":"studio","repoPath":"diskrotrepo/studio","stars":5,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T11:07:02Z","topics":["ai-music","ai-music-tools"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"acestep-docs","description":"ACE-Step documentation and troubleshooting. Use when users ask about installing ACE-Step, GPU configuration, model download, Gradio UI usage, API integration, or troubleshooting issues like VRAM problems, CUDA errors, or model loading failures.","bodyPreview":"# ACE-Step Documentation\n\nDocumentation skill for ACE-Step music generation system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Getting Started\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [README.md](getting-started/README.md) | Installation, model download, startup commands |\n| [Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md) | Getting started tutorial, best practices |\n| [ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md) | Project overview, architecture, model zoo |\n\n### Guides\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|---","body":"# ACE-Step Documentation\n\nDocumentation skill for ACE-Step music generation system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Getting Started\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [README.md](getting-started/README.md) | Installation, model download, startup commands |\n| [Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md) | Getting started tutorial, best practices |\n| [ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md) | Project overview, architecture, model zoo |\n\n### Guides\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [GRADIO_GUIDE.md](guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md) | Web UI usage guide |\n| [INFERENCE.md](guides/INFERENCE.md) | Inference parameters tuning |\n| [GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md](guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md) | GPU/VRAM configuration, hardware recommendations |\n| [ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md](guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md) | Environment detection, uv installation, python_embeded setup (Windows/Linux/macOS) |\n| [SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md](guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md) | Configuring launch scripts: .bat (Windows) and .sh (Linux/macOS) |\n| [UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md](guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md) | Git updates, file backup, conflict resolution (all platforms) |\n\n### API (for developers)\n| Document | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| [API.md](api/API.md) | REST API documentation |\n| [Openrouter_API.md](api/Openrouter_API.md) | OpenRouter API integration |\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Installation questions → read [getting-started/README.md](getting-started/README.md)\n2. General usage / best practices → read [getting-started/Tutorial.md](getting-started/Tutorial.md)\n3. Project overview / architecture → read [getting-started/ABOUT.md](getting-started/ABOUT.md)\n4. Web UI questions → read [guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md](guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md)\n5. Inference parameter tuning → read [guides/INFERENCE.md](guides/INFERENCE.md)\n6. GPU/VRAM issues → read [guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md](guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md)\n7. Environment setup (uv, python_embeded) → read [guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md](guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md)\n8. Launch script configuration (.bat/.sh) → read [guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md](guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md)\n9. Updates and backup → read [guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md](guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md)\n10. API development → read [api/API.md](api/API.md) or [api/Openrouter_API.md](api/Openrouter_API.md)\n\n## Common Issues\n\n- **Installation problems**: See getting-started/README.md\n- **VRAM insufficient**: See guides/GPU_COMPATIBILITY.md\n- **Model download failed**: See getting-started/README.md or guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md\n- **uv not found**: See guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md\n- **Environment detection issues**: See guides/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md\n- **BAT/SH script configuration**: See guides/SCRIPT_CONFIGURATION.md\n- **Update and backup**: See guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md\n- **Update conflicts**: See guides/UPDATE_AND_BACKUP.md\n- **Inference quality issues**: See guides/INFERENCE.md\n- **Gradio UI not starting**: See guides/GRADIO_GUIDE.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:56:13.431Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Music Generation Agents requiring comprehensive documentation for the ACE-Step music generation system","zh":"适合需要对 ACE-Step 音乐生成系统进行全面文档说明的音乐生成代理","ja":"ACE-Step 音楽生成システムの包括的なドキュメントが必要な音楽生成エージェントに最適","ko":"ACE-Step 음악 생성 시스템에 대한 포괄적인 문서가 필요한 음악 생성 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Música que requieren documentación completa para el sistema de generación de música ACE-Step","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Génération de Musique nécessitant une documentation complète pour le système de génération de musique ACE-Step","de":"Ideal für Musik-Generierungsagenten, die umfassende Dokumentation für das ACE-Step-Musik-Generierungssystem benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Música que exigem documentação abrangente para o sistema de geração de música ACE-Step","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Генерации Музыки, требующих всесторонней документации для системы генерации музыки ACE-Step","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء توليد الموسيقى الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق شامل لنظام توليد الموسيقى ACE-Step"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master ACE-Step through detailed guides and tutorials, including model download and startup commands, utilizing README.md, Tutorial.md, and ABOUT.md files for optimal understanding of the project''s architecture and model zoo","zh":"通过详细的指南和教程，包括模型下载和启动命令，利用 README.md、Tutorial.md 和 ABOUT.md 文件，实现对项目架构和模型库的最佳理解，从而使代理能够掌握 ACE-Step","ja":"README.md、Tutorial.md、ABOUT.md ファイルを使用して、モデルダウンロードと起動コマンドを含む詳細なガイドとチュートリアルを提供し、プロジェクトのアーキテクチャとモデルズーの最適な理解を実現し、ACE-Step をマスターできるようにエージェントをエンパワーする","ko":"README.md, Tutorial.md, ABOUT.md 파일을 사용하여 모델 다운로드 및 시작 명령을 포함한 자세한 가이드와 튜토리얼을 제공하여 프로젝트 아키텍처 및 모델 구의 최적의 이해를 실현하고 ACE-Step을 마스터할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar ACE-Step a través de guías y tutoriales detallados, incluyendo comandos de descarga de modelos y de inicio, utilizando archivos README.md, Tutorial.md y ABOUT.md para una comprensión óptima de la arquitectura del proyecto y del zoológico de modelos","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser ACE-Step grâce à des guides et des didacticiels détaillés, y compris les commandes de téléchargement de modèles et de démarrage, en utilisant les fichiers README.md, Tutorial.md et ABOUT.md pour une compréhension optimale de l''architecture du projet et du zoo de modèles","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ACE-Step durch detaillierte Anleitungen und Tutorials zu meistern, einschließlich Modell-Download- und Startbefehlen, unter Verwendung der Dateien README.md, Tutorial.md und ABOUT.md für ein optimales Verständnis der Projekarchitektur und des Modellzoos","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar o ACE-Step por meio de guias e tutoriais detalhados, incluindo comandos de download e inicialização do modelo, utilizando arquivos README.md, Tutorial.md e ABOUT.md para entendimento ótimo da arquitetura do projeto e do zoológico de modelos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью освоить ACE-Step посредством подробных руководств и уроков, включая команды загрузки и запуска модели, используя файлы README.md, Tutorial.md и ABOUT.md для оптимального понимания архитектуры проекта и зоопарка моделей","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إتقان ACE-Step من خلال دلائل وتعليمات مفصّلة، بما في ذلك أوامر تحميل وبدء تشغيل النموذج، باستخدام ملفات README.md و Tutorial.md و ABOUT.md لفهم مثالي للبنية التحتية للمشروع ومتحف النماذج"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging ACE-Step model implementations","Generating music with ACE-Step tutorials","Understanding ACE-Step project architecture"],"zh":["调试 ACE-Step 模型实现","使用 ACE-Step 教程生成音乐","理解 ACE-Step 项目架构"],"ja":["ACE-Step モデル実装のデバッグ","ACE-Step チュートリアルを使用した音楽生成","ACE-Step プロジェクトアーキテクチャの理解"],"ko":["ACE-Step 모델 구현 디버깅","ACE-Step 튜토리얼을 사용한 음악 생성","ACE-Step 프로젝트 아키텍처 이해"],"es":["Depuración de implementaciones de modelos ACE-Step","Generación de música con tutoriales ACE-Step","Comprensión de la arquitectura del proyecto ACE-Step"],"fr":["Débogage des implémentations de modèles ACE-Step","Génération de musique avec des didacticiels ACE-Step","Compréhension de l''architecture du projet ACE-Step"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei der Implementierung von ACE-Step-Modellen","Generierung von Musik mit ACE-Step-Tutorials","Verständnis der Projekarchitektur von ACE-Step"],"pt":["Depuração de implementações de modelos ACE-Step","Geração de música com tutoriais ACE-Step","Compreensão da arquitetura do projeto ACE-Step"],"ru":["Отладка реализаций моделей ACE-Step","Генерация музыки с помощью уроков ACE-Step","Понимание архитектуры проекта ACE-Step"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء تطبيق نماذج ACE-Step","توليد الموسيقى باستخدام دروس ACE-Step","فهم هيكل مشروع ACE-Step"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ACE-Step documentation files","Specific to ACE-Step music generation system"],"zh":["需要访问 ACE-Step 文档文件","特定于 ACE-Step 音乐生成系统"],"ja":["ACE-Step ドキュメントファイルへのアクセスが必要","ACE-Step 音楽生成システムに特有"],"ko":["ACE-Step 문서 파일에 접근할 수 있어야 함","ACE-Step 음악 생성 시스템에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de documentación de ACE-Step","Específico para el sistema de generación de música ACE-Step"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers de documentation ACE-Step","Spécifique au système de génération de musique ACE-Step"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Dokumentationsdateien von ACE-Step","Spezifisch für das ACE-Step-Musik-Generierungssystem"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de documentação ACE-Step","Específico para o sistema de geração de música ACE-Step"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам документации ACE-Step","Специфичен для системы генерации музыки ACE-Step"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات توثيق ACE-Step","م