lo de temas con Liquid","Comercio headless con Storefront API","Soluciones de checkout personalizadas","Optimización de tiendas para tiempos de carga inferiores a 2 segundos","Flujos de checkout optimizados para la conversión","Arquitectura de aplicaciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Développement de thèmes avec Liquid","Commerce headless avec Storefront API","Solutions de checkout personnalisées","Optimisation de boutiques pour des temps de chargement inférieurs à 2 secondes","Flux de checkout optimisés pour la conversion","Architecture d''applications personnalisées"],"de":["Theme-Entwicklung mit Liquid","Headless-Commerce mit Storefront API","Benutzerdefinierte Checkout-Lösungen","Optimierung von Shops für Ladezeiten unter 2 Sekunden","Checkout-Flüsse optimiert für die Konversion","Benutzerdefinierte App-Architektur"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de temas personalizados com Liquid","Comércio headless com Storefront API","Desenvolvimento de aplicações personalizadas para Shopify","Checkout personalizado e otimizado","Otimização de desempenho para tempos de carregamento inferiores a 2 segundos"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных тем с использованием Liquid","Headless коммерция с Storefront API","Разработка настраиваемых приложений для Shopify","Настраиваемый и оптимизированный checkout","Оптимизация производительности для времени загрузки менее 2 секунд"],"ar":["تطوير مواضيع مخصصة باستخدام Liquid","التجارة بدون رأس مع Storefront API","تطوير تطبيقات مخصصة لشوبيفاي","Checkout مخصص ومحسّن","تحسين الأداء لتحقيق أوقات تحميل أقل من 2 ثانية"]},"keywords":{"en":["shopify expert definition","how to use shopify expert","shopify expert vs shopify plus","shopify expert setup guide","shopify expert theme development","shopify expert headless commerce","shopify expert custom checkout","shopify expert install","shopify expert alternative","shopify expert tutorial"],"zh":["Shopify Expert","Shopify 开发","Liquid","Headless Commerce","Storefront API","自定义结账解决方案","高性能商店建设"],"ja":["Shopify エキスパート","Shopify 開発","Liquid","ヘッドレス コマース","Storefront API","カスタム チェックアウト ソリューション","高性能ストア構築"],"ko":["Shopify Expert","Shopify 개발","Liquid","헤드리스 커머스","Storefront API","커스텀 결제 솔루션","고성능 스토어 구축"],"es":["shopify expert","desarrollo de temas shopify","comercio headless shopify","soluciones de checkout personalizadas","optimización de tiendas shopify","liquid shopify","storefront api shopify","arquitectura de aplicaciones shopify"],"fr":["expert shopify","développement de thèmes shopify","commerce headless shopify","solutions de checkout personnalisées","optimisation de boutiques shopify","liquid shopify","storefront api shopify","architecture d''applications shopify"],"de":["shopify-experte","theme-entwicklung shopify","headless-commerce shopify","benutzerdefinierte checkout-lösungen","optimierung von shops shopify","liquid shopify","storefront api shopify","app-architektur shopify"],"pt":["shopify expert","desenvolvimento de temas shopify","comércio headless shopify","liquid shopify","storefront api shopify","checkout personalizado shopify","otimização de desempenho shopify"],"ru":["ИИ Агент Shopify Expert","разработка тем шопифай","headless коммерция шопифай","liquid шопифай","storefront api шопифай","настраиваемый checkout шопифай","оптимизация производительности шопифай"],"ar":["خبير شوبيفاي","تطوير مواضيع شوبيفاي","التجارة بدون رأس شوبيفاي","liquid شوبيفاي","storefront api شوبيفاي","Checkout مخصص شوبيفاي","تحسين الأداء شوبيفاي"]}},"owner":"fulfon","repo":"lusena-dawn","repoPath":"fulfon/lusena-dawn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.226Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shopify-expert","description":"Use when building Shopify themes, apps, custom storefronts, or e-commerce solutions. Invoke for Liquid templating, Storefront API, app development, checkout customization, Shopify Plus features.","bodyPreview":"# Shopify Expert\n\nSenior Shopify developer with expertise in theme development, headless commerce, app architecture, and custom checkout solutions.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Shopify developer with deep e-commerce experience. You specialize in Shopify theme development with Liquid, headless commerce with Storefront API, custom Shopify app development, and checkout extensibility. You build high-performing stores achieving sub-2s load times and conversion-optimized checkout flows.\n\n## W","body":"# Shopify Expert\n\nSenior Shopify developer with expertise in theme development, headless commerce, app architecture, and custom checkout solutions.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior Shopify developer with deep e-commerce experience. You specialize in Shopify theme development with Liquid, headless commerce with Storefront API, custom Shopify app development, and checkout extensibility. You build high-performing stores achieving sub-2s load times and conversion-optimized checkout flows.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building or customizing Shopify themes\n- Creating headless storefronts with Hydrogen or custom React\n- Developing Shopify apps with OAuth and webhooks\n- Implementing checkout UI extensions or Shopify Functions\n- Optimizing theme performance and conversion rates\n- Integrating third-party services with Shopify\n- Building Shopify Plus merchant solutions\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Requirements analysis** - Identify if theme, app, or headless approach fits needs\n2. **Architecture setup** - Configure theme structure, app scaffolding, or API integration\n3. **Implementation** - Build Liquid templates, GraphQL queries, or app features\n4. **Optimization** - Performance tuning, asset optimization, checkout flow refinement\n5. **Deploy and test** - Theme deployment, app submission, production monitoring\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Liquid Templating | `references/liquid-templating.md` | Theme development, template customization |\n| Storefront API | `references/storefront-api.md` | Headless commerce, Hydrogen, custom frontends |\n| App Development | `references/app-development.md` | Building Shopify apps, OAuth, webhooks |\n| Checkout Extensions | `references/checkout-customization.md` | Checkout UI extensions, Shopify Functions |\n| Performance | `references/performance-optimization.md` | Theme speed, asset optimization, caching |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Use Liquid 2.0 syntax for themes\n- Implement proper metafield handling\n- Use Storefront API 2024-10 or newer\n- Optimize images with Shopify CDN filters\n- Follow Shopify CLI workflows\n- Use App Bridge for embedded apps\n- Implement proper error handling for API calls\n- Follow Shopify theme architecture patterns\n- Use TypeScript for app development\n- Test checkout extensions in sandbox\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Hardcode API credentials in theme code\n- Exceed Storefront API rate limits (2000 points/sec)\n- Use deprecated REST Admin API endpoints\n- Skip GDPR compliance for customer data\n- Deploy untested checkout extensions\n- Use synchronous API calls in Liquid (deprecated)\n- Ignore theme performance metrics\n- Store sensitive data in metafields without encryption\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing Shopify solutions, provide:\n1. Complete file structure with proper naming\n2. Liquid/GraphQL/TypeScript code with types\n3. Configuration files (shopify.app.toml, schema settings)\n4. API scopes and permissions needed\n5. Testing approach and deployment steps\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nShopify CLI 3.x, Liquid 2.0, Storefront API 2024-10, Admin API, GraphQL, Hydrogen 2024, Remix, Oxygen, Polaris, App Bridge 4.0, Checkout UI Extensions, Shopify Functions, metafields, metaobjects, theme architecture, Shopify Plus features\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **React Expert** - For Hydrogen and headless frontends\n- **GraphQL Architect** - Advanced Storefront API patterns\n- **API Designer** - Custom app API design\n- **Frontend Developer** - Theme UI/UX implementation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T14:12:31.528Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing advanced Shopify theme development and headless commerce capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Shopify主题开发和无头商务功能的电子商务代理","ja":"電子商取引エージェントが高度なShopifyテーマ開発とヘッドレスコマース機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 Shopify 테마 개발 및 헤드리스 커머스 기능이 필요한 전자상거래 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan desarrollo de temas avanzados de Shopify y capacidades de comercio sin cabeza.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''un développement de thèmes Shopify avancé et de capacités de commerce sans tête.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine fortschrittliche Shopify-Themenentwicklung und Headless-Commerce-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que necessitam de desenvolvimento avançado de temas do Shopify e capacidades de comércio headless.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки тем Shopify и функции headless-коммерции.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التجارة الإلكترونية التي تحتاج إلى تطوير متقدم لمواضيع Shopify وقدرات التجارة بدون رأس."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build high-performing Shopify stores with optimized checkout flows using Liquid, Storefront API, and custom checkout extensibility, achieving sub-2s load times and conversion-optimized results.","zh":"赋予代理商使用Liquid、Storefront API和自定义结账扩展能力，打造高性能的Shopify商店，实现优化的结账流程，达到2秒以内的加载时间和转化率优化的结果","ja":"Liquid、Storefront API、カスタムチェックアウトの拡張機能を使用して、高パフォーマンスのShopifyストアを構築し、チェックアウトフローを最適化して2秒未満のロード時間とコンバージョン最適化の結果を実現","ko":"Liquid, Storefront API 및 사용자 정의 체크아웃 확장 기능을 사용하여 고성능 Shopify 상점을 구축하고 체크아웃 흐름을 최적화하여 2초 이내의 로드 시간과 전환률 최적화 결과를 달성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear tiendas Shopify de alto rendimiento con flujos de pago optimizados utilizando Liquid, Storefront API y extensibilidad de pago personalizada, logrando tiempos de carga inferiores a 2 segundos y resultados optimizados para la conversión.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des magasins Shopify haute performance avec des flux de paiement optimisés en utilisant Liquid, Storefront API et une extensibilité de paiement personnalisée, atteignant des temps de chargement inférieurs à 2 secondes et des résultats optimisés pour la conversion.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochleistungsfähige Shopify-Store mit optimierten Checkout-Flows zu erstellen, die Liquid, Storefront API und benutzerdefinierte Checkout-Erweiterbarkeit verwenden, um Ladezeiten unter 2 Sekunden und konversionsoptimierte Ergebnisse zu erzielen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir lojas do Shopify de alto desempenho com fluxos de checkout otimizados usando Liquid, Storefront API e extensibilidade personalizada de checkout, alcançando tempos de carregamento inferiores a 2s e resultados otimizados para conversão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные магазины Shopify с оптимизированными потоками оформления заказа с использованием Liquid, Storefront API и настраиваемой расширяемости оформления заказа, достигая времени загрузки менее 2с и результатов, оптимизированных для конверсии.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء متاجر Shopify ذات أداء عالي مع تدفقات الدفع المُحسّنة باستخدام Liquid و Storefront API والتمديدات المخصصة للدفع، وتحقيق أوقات تحميل أقل من 2 ثانية ونتائج محسّنة للتَحوّلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom Shopify themes with Liquid","Implementing headless commerce solutions with Storefront API","Optimizing checkout flows for improved conversion rates"],"zh":["使用Liquid开发自定义Shopify主题","使用Storefront API实现无头商务解决方案","优化结账流程以提高转化率"],"ja":["Liquidを使用してカスタムShopifyテーマを開発","Storefront APIを使用してヘッドレスコマースソリューションを実装","チェックアウトフローを最適化してコンバージョン率を向上"],"ko":["Liquid를 사용하여 사용자 정의 Shopify 테마 개발","Storefront API를 사용하여 헤드리스 커머스 솔루션 구현","체크아웃 흐름을 최적화하여 전환률을 개선"],"es":["Desarrollar temas personalizados de Shopify con Liquid","Implementar soluciones de comercio sin cabeza con Storefront API","Optimizar flujos de pago para mejorar las tasas de conversión"],"fr":["Développer des thèmes personnalisés Shopify avec Liquid","Mettre en œuvre des solutions de commerce sans tête avec Storefront API","Optimiser les flux de paiement pour améliorer les taux de conversion"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierte Shopify-Themen mit Liquid entwickeln","Headless-Commerce-Lösungen mit Storefront API implementieren","Checkout-Flows optimieren, um die Konversionsraten zu verbessern"],"pt":["Desenvolver temas personalizados do Shopify com Liquid","Implementar soluções de comércio headless com Storefront API","Otimizar fluxos de checkout para taxas de conversão aprimoradas"],"ru":["Разработка пользовательских тем Shopify с помощью Liquid","Реализация решений headless-коммерции с помощью Storefront API","Оптимизация потоков оформления заказа для улучшения показателей конверсии"],"ar":["تطوير مواضيع مخصصة من Shopify باستخدام Liquid","تنفيذ حلول التجارة بدون رأس باستخدام Storefront API","تحسين تدفقات الدفع لتحسين معدلات التحويل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Shopify development","Limited to Shopify platform","Dependent on Storefront API and Liquid templating engine"],"zh":["需要Shopify开发专业知识","仅限Shopify平台","依赖Storefront API和Liquid模板引擎"],"ja":["Shopify開発の専門知識が必要","Shopifyプラットフォームに限られる","Storefront APIとLiquidテンプレートエンジンに依存"],"ko":["Shopify 개발 전문 지식이 필요","Shopify 플랫폼에만 한정","Storefront API 및 Liquid 템플릿 엔진에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en desarrollo de Shopify","Limitado a la plataforma Shopify","Dependiente de Storefront API y del motor de plantillas Liquid"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en développement Shopify","Limité à la plateforme Shopify","Dépendant de Storefront API et du moteur de modèles Liquid"],"de":["Benötigt Erfahrung in der Shopify-Entwicklung","Begrenzt auf die Shopify-Plattform","Abhängig von Storefront API und Liquid-Vorlagen-Engine"],"pt":["Exige especialização em desenvolvimento do Shopify","Limitado à plataforma do Shopify","Dependente da Storefront API e do motor de template Liquid"],"ru":["Требует специализации в разработке Shopify","Ограничен платформой Shopify","Зависит от Storefront API и движка шаблонов Liquid"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في تطوير Shopify","محدود منصة Shopify","يعتمد على Storefront API و محرك قوالب Liquid"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ce496a25af2e2a9c11c179fa4131e1a18f141080460641536ef2f840074c9fd6","qualityScore":44}');
