ng-engineer","project-docling-engineer tutorial","docling engineer workflow","python docx workflow automation"],"zh":["Project Docling Engineer","Python + Docling + DOCX 工作流","AI 工具","工作流优化","架构清晰","测试性","分阶段交付"],"ja":["Project Docling Engineer","Python + Docling + DOCX ワークフロー","AI エージェント","ワークフロー最適化","設計の明確性","テスト性","段階的な納品"],"ko":["Project Docling Engineer","Python + Docling + DOCX 워크플ロー","AI 에이전트","워크플ロー 최적화","아키텍처의 명확성","테스트 가능성","단계적 인도"],"es":["Project Docling Engineer","Python y Docling","flujos de trabajo de DOCX","cambios de producción de grado","arquitectura de software","Herramientas de desarrollo de software","Desarrollo de software ágil","ingeniería de software","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Agentes de IA para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Project Docling Engineer","Python et Docling","flux de travail DOCX","modifications de production de grade","architecture logicielle","Outils de développement de logiciel","Développement de logiciel agile","ingénierie de logiciel","Outils d''IA pour développeurs","Agents d''IA pour développeurs"],"de":["Project Docling Engineer","Python und Docling","DOCX-Workflows","produktionsreife Änderungen","Softwarearchitektur","Software-Entwicklungstools","Agile Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agenten für Entwickler"],"pt":["Project Docling Engineer","workflows Python","Docling","DOCX","engenharia de documentação","arquitetura de software","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Project Docling Engineer","рабочие процессы Python","Docling","DOCX","инженерия документации","архитектура программного обеспечения","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Project Docling Engineer","تدفقات العمل Python","Docling","DOCX","هندسة وثائقية","هندسة برمجيات","تطوير برمجيات","أدوات تطوير"]}},"owner":"qcdeveloper3-cmd","repo":"new-chapter","repoPath":"qcdeveloper3-cmd/new-chapter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-21T05:03:56Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-docling-engineer","description":"Engineer robust Python document-processing systems for this repository. Use when tasks involve Docling-first analysis, OCR/table fallback design, editable DOCX generation, RTL/LTR mixed text handling, project scaffolding, CI/tooling setup, or implementation planning and execution that must prioritize correctness, maintainability, and practical delivery.","bodyPreview":"# Project Docling Engineer\n\n## Overview\n\nPlan and implement production-grade changes for Python + Docling + DOCX workflows in this repo. Prioritize architecture clarity, testability, and staged delivery over quick but fragile code.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm target outcomes and acceptance criteria before writing code.\n2. Inspect current state first (`tree`, `rg`, config, tests, CI).\n3. Propose minimal viable architecture changes with explicit tradeoffs.\n4. Implement in thin vertical slices:\n   - k","body":"# Project Docling Engineer\n\n## Overview\n\nPlan and implement production-grade changes for Python + Docling + DOCX workflows in this repo. Prioritize architecture clarity, testability, and staged delivery over quick but fragile code.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm target outcomes and acceptance criteria before writing code.\n2. Inspect current state first (`tree`, `rg`, config, tests, CI).\n3. Propose minimal viable architecture changes with explicit tradeoffs.\n4. Implement in thin vertical slices:\n   - keep stage boundaries clean (`preprocess`, `analyze`, `render-docx`, `validate`)\n   - use interfaces/adapters for engines and fallbacks\n   - keep IR stable and version-aware\n5. Add verification with every slice:\n   - unit tests for pure logic and schema\n   - CLI smoke tests for orchestration\n   - artifact checks for deterministic outputs\n6. Report residual risks and clear next steps.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n\n- Keep modules cohesive; avoid monolithic stage files.\n- Preserve editability in DOCX output: prefer native paragraphs/tables/checkbox-like symbols before raster overlays.\n- Preserve geometry explicitly in IR; avoid lossy implicit conversions.\n- Treat mixed-direction text as first-class: store direction metadata on lines/spans/cells.\n- Make fallback behavior explicit and observable in logs/metadata.\n- Avoid hidden global state; pass context/config through stage boundaries.\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n- Run lint/format/type/test before finalizing:\n  - `ruff check src tests`\n  - `ruff format --check src tests`\n  - `mypy src`\n  - `pytest`\n- Run CLI smoke checks:\n  - `python -m docmirror --help`\n  - `python -m docmirror run-all <sample.jpg> -o out`\n- Validate that logs and debug artifacts are generated in configured paths.\n\n## Use Bundled References\n\n- For Docling integration details and option selection: read `references/docling-implementation-guide.md`.\n- For engineering behavior and delivery checks: read `references/engineering-checklist.md`.\n- For DOCX/RTL implementation notes: read `references/docx-rtl-notes.md`.\n\n## Use Bundled Script\n\n- `scripts/run_quality_gate.py` runs the standard local quality checks in one command.\n\n## Output Expectations\n\n- Deliver concrete code changes, validation evidence, and a short risk list.\n- Do not stop at abstract advice when implementation is feasible.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:50:24.915Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python-based AI Agents needing advanced document workflow management with Docling and DOCX","zh":"适合需要使用Python基于的AI代理高级文档工作流管理的Docling和DOCX","ja":"PythonベースのAIエージェントがDoclingおよびDOCXを使用した高度なドキュメントワークフローマネージメントを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"Python 기반 AI 에이전트가 Docling 및 DOCX를 사용하여 고급 문서 워크플로 관리를 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA basados en Python que necesitan una gestión de flujo de documentos avanzada con Docling y DOCX","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Python ayant besoin d''une gestion de flux de documents avancée avec Docling et DOCX","de":"Perfekt für Python-basierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Dokumenten-Workflow-Verwaltung mit Docling und DOCX benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Python que necessitam de gerenciamento avançado de fluxo de trabalho de documentos com Docling e DOCX","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Python, требующих продвинутого управления документооборотом с помощью Docling и DOCX","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية المبنية على بايثون التي تحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لتدفق العمل الوثائقي مع Docling و DOCX"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to plan and implement production-grade changes for Python + Docling + DOCX workflows, prioritizing architecture clarity and testability through staged delivery and minimal viable architecture changes","zh":"赋予代理规划和实施针对Python + Docling + DOCX工作流的生产级别更改的能力，优先考虑通过分阶段交付和最小可行架构更改来实现架构清晰度和可测试性","ja":"Python + Docling + DOCXワークフローに対する生産グレードの変更を計画して実施するエージェントの能力を与え、ステージドデリバリーと最小限の実行可能なアーキテクチャ変更を通じてアーキテクチャの明確さとテスト可能性を優先する","ko":"Python + Docling + DOCX 워크플로우에 대한 생산급 변경을 계획하고 구현할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 단계별 배포 및 최소한의 실행 가능한 아키텍처 변경을 통해 아키텍처의 명확성과 테스트 가능성을 우선시한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a planificar e implementar cambios de grado de producción para flujos de trabajo de Python + Docling + DOCX, priorizando la claridad de la arquitectura y la prueba a través de la entrega por etapas y los cambios mínimos de arquitectura viable","fr":"Permet aux agents de planifier et de mettre en œuvre des modifications de grade de production pour les flux de travail Python + Docling + DOCX, en donnant la priorité à la clarté de l''architecture et à la testabilité grâce à la livraison échelonnée et aux modifications minimales d''architecture viable","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Produktionsgrade-Änderungen für Python + Docling + DOCX-Workflows zu planen und umzusetzen, wobei die Klarheit der Architektur und die Testbarkeit durch schrittweise Lieferung und minimale lebensfähige Architekturänderungen priorisiert werde