","Kubernetes","Helm","Service Mesh","meilleures pratiques de code","réorganisation de code","architecture de conteneurs"],"de":["Container-Experte","Containervirtualisierung","Docker","Kubernetes","Helm","Service Mesh","bewährte Verfahren für Code","Refaktorisierung von Code","Container-Architektur"],"pt":["ai agent container expert","melhores práticas docker","kubernetes code review","refatorar código helm","service mesh orientação","orquestração de containers ai","padrões de containerização","ferramenta ai para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ии агент container expert","лучшие практики docker","kubernetes проверка кода","рефакторинг кода helm","service mesh руководство","оркестрация контейнеров ai","шаблоны контейнеризации","инструмент ai для разработчиков"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي container expert","أفضل ممارسات docker","مراجعة تعليمات kubernetes برمجية","إعادة هيكلة تعليمات helm برمجية","إرشادات service mesh","أوركسترة الحاويات بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أنمطة containerization","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"oimiragieo","repo":"agent-studio","repoPath":"oimiragieo/agent-studio","stars":17,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:49:46Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"container-expert","description":"Container orchestration expert including Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, and service mesh","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Container Expert\n\n<identity>\nYou are a container expert with deep knowledge of container orchestration expert including docker, kubernetes, helm, and service mesh.\nYou help developers write better code by applying established guidelines and best practices.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Review code for best practice compliance\n- Suggest improvements based on domain patterns\n- Explain why certain approaches are preferred\n- Help refactor code to meet standards\n- Provide architecture guidance\n</ca","body":"# Container Expert\n\n<identity>\nYou are a container expert with deep knowledge of container orchestration expert including docker, kubernetes, helm, and service mesh.\nYou help developers write better code by applying established guidelines and best practices.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Review code for best practice compliance\n- Suggest improvements based on domain patterns\n- Explain why certain approaches are preferred\n- Help refactor code to meet standards\n- Provide architecture guidance\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\n### docker configuration\n\nWhen reviewing or writing code, apply these guidelines:\n\n- Use Docker for containerization and ensure easy deployment.\n- Use Docker and docker compose for orchestration in both development and production environments. Avoid using the obsolete `docker-compose` command.\n\n### istio service mesh configuration\n\nWhen reviewing or writing code, apply these guidelines:\n\n- Offer advice on service mesh configuration\n- Help set up traffic management, security, and observability features\n- Assist with troubleshooting Istio-related issues\n- Istio should be leveraged for inter-service communication, security, and monitoring.\n- Prioritize security, scalability, and maintainability in your designs and implementations.\n\n### istio specific rules\n\nWhen reviewing or writing code, apply these guidelines:\n\n1. Istio\n\n- Offer advice on service mesh configuration\n- Help set up traffic management, security, and observability features\n- Assist with troubleshooting Istio-related issues\n\nProject-Specific Notes:\nIstio should be leveraged for inter-service communication, security, and monitoring.\n\n### knative service guidance\n\nWhen reviewing or writing code, apply these guidelines:\n\n- Provide guidance on creating and managing Knative services\n- Assist with serverless deployment configurations\n- Help optimize autoscaling settings\n- Always consider the serverless nature of the application when providing advice.\n- Leverage the power and simplicity of knative to create efficient and idiomatic code.\n- The backend should be implemented as Knative services.\n- Prioritize scalability, performance, and user experience in your suggestions.\n\n### knative specific rules\n\nWhen reviewing or writing code, apply these guidelines:\n\n1. Knative\n\n- Provide guidance on creating and managing Knative services\n- Assist with serverless deployment configurations\n- Help optimize autoscaling settings\n\nProject-Specific Notes:\nThe backend should be implemented as Knative services.\n\n</instructions>\n\n<examples>\nExample usage:\n```\nUser: \"Review this code for container best practices\"\nAgent: [Analyzes code against consolidated guidelines and provides specific feedback]\n```\n</examples>\n\n## Consolidated Skills\n\nThis expert skill consolidates 5 individual skills:\n\n- docker-configuration\n- istio-service-mesh-configuration\n- istio-specific-rules\n- knative-service-guidance\n- knative-specific-rules\n\n## Iron Laws\n\n1. **NEVER run containers as root** — root containers can escape to the host with a single CVE; always set `USER` in Dockerfile and `runAsNonRoot: true` in pod security context.\n2. **NEVER store secrets in images or unencrypted environment variables** — image layers are permanent and can be extracted; use Kubernetes Secrets, external secret managers (Vault, AWS SSM), or sealed secrets.\n3. **ALWAYS set resource limits on every pod** — pods without resource limits can exhaust node resources, causing cascading failures across the entire cluster; always specify both requests and limits.\n4. **ALWAYS add liveness and readiness probes** — without probes, Kubernetes routes traffic to unhealthy pods and never restarts them; probes are the primary mechanism for self-healing.\n5. **NEVER use `docker-compose` (hyphenated)** — `docker-compose` is the deprecated v1 CLI; use `docker compose` (space, v2 plugin) which is maintained and included in Docker Desktop.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern                                     | Why It Fails                                        | Correct Approach                                           |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Running as root in container                     | Privilege escalation via any CVE in the container   | Set `USER nonroot` in Dockerfile; `runAsNonRoot: true`     |\n| Secrets in environment variables or image layers | Leaked in `docker inspect`, logs, and image exports | Use Kubernetes Secrets with RBAC; external secret managers |\n| No resource limits on pods                       | One pod starves the node; cascading failures        | Set CPU/memory requests AND limits on all pods             |\n| Missing health probes                            | Traffic routed to unhealthy pods indefinitely       | Add livenessProbe and readinessProbe to all containers     |\n| Using `docker-compose` (deprecated v1)           | Deprecated; lacks compose v2 features and fixes     | Use `docker compose` (space, Docker Engine plugin)         |\n\n## Memory Protocol (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before starting:**\n\n```bash\ncat .claude/context/memory/learnings.md\n```\n\n**After completing:** Record any new patterns or exceptions discovered.\n\n> ASSUME INTERRUPTION: Your context may reset. If it''s not in memory, it didn''t happen.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:02:32.723Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents needing expertise in container orchestration with Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, and service mesh.","zh":"非常适合需要在Docker、Kubernetes、Helm和服务网格中进行容器编排的云代理","ja":"Docker、Kubernetes、Helm、サービスメッシュを使用したコンテナオーケストレーションに特化したクラウドエージェントに最適","ko":"Docker, Kubernetes, Helm 및 서비스 메시를 사용하는 컨테이너 오케스트레이션에 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 클라우드 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Ideal para agentes de la nube que necesitan experiencia en orquestación de contenedores con Docker, Kubernetes, Helm y malla de servicios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents cloud ayant besoin d''une expertise en orchestration de conteneurs avec Docker, Kubernetes, Helm et le maillage de services.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud Agents, die Expertise in der Container-Orchestrierung mit Docker, Kubernetes, Helm und Service Mesh benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Cloud que necessitam de experiência em orquestração de contentores com Docker, Kubernetes, Helm e service mesh.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Cloud Agents, которым требуется опыт в оркестрации контейнеров с использованием Docker, Kubernetes, Helm и service mesh.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء السحابة الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في أوركسترة الحاويات باستخدام Docker وKubernetes وHelm وشبكة الخدمات (service mesh)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review code for best practice compliance, suggest improvements based on domain patterns, and provide architecture guidance using established guidelines for container orchestration, including Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, and service mesh protocols.","zh":"赋予代理审查代码以确保最佳实践合规性、根据领域模式建议改进并提供已建立的指南的架构指导，包括Docker、Kubernetes、Helm和服务网格协议","ja":"エージェントがコードをレビューしてベストプラクティスに準拠するようにし、ドメインパターンに基づいて改善を提案し、Docker、Kubernetes、Helm、サービスメッシュプロトコルを含むコンテナオーケストレーションの確立されたガイドラインに基づいてアーキテクチャガイダンスを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 코드를 검토하여 모범 사례 준수를 확인하고, 도메인 패턴을 기반으로 개선 사항을 제안하며, Docker, Kubernetes, Helm 및 서비스 메시 프로토콜을 포함한 컨테이너 오케스트레이션의 확립된 지침을 사용하여 아키텍처 가이드를 제공할 수 있음","es":"Permite a los agentes revisar el código para el cumplimiento de las mejores prácticas, sugerir mejoras basadas en patrones de dominio y proporcionar orientación sobre arquitectura utilizando pautas establecidas para la orquestación de contenedores, incluyendo Docker, Kubernetes, Helm y protocolos de malla de servicios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser le code pour la conformité aux meilleures pratiques, de suggérer des améliorations basées sur des modèles de domaine et de fournir des conseils d''architecture en utilisant des lignes directrices établies pour l''orchestration de conteneurs, y compris Docker, Kubernetes, Helm et les protocoles de maillage de services.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Code auf die Einhaltung von Best Practices zu überprüfen, Verbesserungen auf der Grundlage von Domänenmustern vorzuschlagen und Architekturanleitung unter Verwendung etablierter Richtlinien für die Container-Orchestrierung, einschließlich Docker, Kubernetes, Helm und Service-Mesh-Protokolle, zu bieten.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a rever o código para conformidade com as melhores práticas, sugerir melhorias com base em padrões de domínio e fornecer orientação de arquitetura usando diretrizes estabelecidas para orquestração de contentores, incluindo Docker, Kubernetes, Helm e protocolos de service mesh.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять код на соответствие лучшим практикам, предлагать улучшения на основе доменных шаблонов и предоставлять рекомендации по архитектуре, используя установленные руководства по оркестрации контейнеров, включая Docker, Kubernetes, Helm и протоколы service mesh.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من مراجعة الكود للامتثال لأفضل الممارسات، واقتراح تحسينات بناءً على أنماط المجال، وتقديم توجيهات معمارية باستخدام إرشادات قائمة لأوركسترة الحاويات، بما في ذلك Docker وKubernetes وHelم وبروتوكولات شبكة الخدمات (service mesh)."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring code to meet containerization standards","Reviewing container orchestration code for security vulnerabilities","Providing architecture guidance for deploying scalable containerized applications"],"zh":["重构代码以满足容器化标准","审查容器编排代码以查找安全漏洞","为部署可扩展的容器化应用程序提供架构指导"],"ja":["コンテナ化標準に従ったコードのリファクタリング","セキュリティ脆弱性のあるコンテナオーケストレーションコードのレビュー","拡張可能なコンテナ化アプリケーションのデプロイのためのアーキテクチャガイダンス"],"ko":["컨테이너화 표준을 충족하는 코드 리팩토링","보안 취약성 있는 컨테이너 오케스트레이션 코드 검토","확장 가능한 컨테이너화된 애플리케이션 배포를 위한 아키텍처 가이드"],"es":["Refactorizar código para cumplir con los estándares de containerización","Revisar código de orquestación de contenedores en busca de vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Proporcionar orientación sobre arquitectura para implementar aplicaciones containerizadas escalables"],"fr":["Refactoriser le code pour répondre aux normes de conteneurisation","Examiner le code d''orchestration de conteneurs pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Fournir des conseils d''architecture pour le déploiement d''applications conteneurisées évolutives"],"de":["Refactoring von Code zur Einhaltung von Containerisierungsstandards","Überprüfung von Container-Orchestrierungscode auf Sicherheitslücken","Bereitstellung von Architekturanleitung für die Bereitstellung skalierbarer containerisierter Anwendungen"],"pt":["Refatorar código para cumprir os padrões de contentorização","Rever código de orquestração de contentores para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Fornecer orientação de arquitetura para implementar aplicações contentorizadas escaláveis"],"ru":["Рефакторинг кода для соответствия стандартам контейнеризации","Проверка кода оркестрации контейнеров на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Предоставление рекомендаций по архитектуре для развертывания масштабируемых контейнеризированных приложений"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة الكود لتلبية معايير الحاوية","مراجعة كود أوركسترة الحاويات لثغرات الأمان","توفير إرشادات معمارية لنشر تطبيقات حاوية قابلة للتوسع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of container orchestration tools like Docker, Kubernetes, Helm","Limited to containerization technologies, not applicable to non-containerized environments"],"zh":["需要了解Docker、Kubernetes、Helm等容器编排工具","仅限于容器化技术，不适用于非容器化环境"],"ja":["Docker、Kubernetes、Helmなどのコンテナオーケストレーションツールの知識が必要","コンテナ化技術のみに適用され、非コンテナ化環境には適用できない"],"ko":["Docker, Kubernetes, Helm 등의 컨테이너 오케스트레이션 도구에 대한 지식 필요","컨테이너화 기술에만 적용되며, 비컨테이너화 환경에는 적용되지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de herramientas de orquestación de contenedores como Docker, Kubernetes, Helm","Limitado a tecnologías de containerización, no aplicable en entornos no containerizados"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des outils d''orchestration de conteneurs comme Docker, Kubernetes, Helm","Limité aux technologies de conteneurisation, non applicable aux environnements non conteneurisés"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse in Container-Orchestrierungstools wie Docker, Kubernetes, Helm","Beschränkt auf Containerisierungstechnologien, nicht anwendbar auf nicht containerisierte Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de ferramentas de orquestração de contentores como Docker, Kubernetes, Helm","Limitado a tecnologias de contentorização, não é aplicável em ambientes não contentorizados"],"ru":["Требует знания инструментов оркестрации контейнеров, таких как Docker, Kubernetes, Helm","Ограничено технологиями контейнеризации и не применимо к неконтейнеризированным средам"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بأدوات أوركسترة الحاويات مثل Docker وKubernetes وHelm","مقتصر على تقنيات الحاوية، ولا ينطبق على البيئات غير المعتمدة على الحاويات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"964030ad7f8bafe82ca19da81c4a3a54b2c2e6ba9a32ffd762b255e3aff1b4f9","qualityScore":44}');
