和特性增强","技术推荐和架构设计","结构化设计和战略规划","AI/ML 项目设计支持","Web 应用程序和移动项目设计支持"],"ja":["構造化設計と戦略的計画","AIエージェントと Web アプリケーションの開発サポート","システム分析と特性強化","技術勧告とアーキテクチャ設計","モバイルプロジェクト設計サポート"],"ko":["체계적인 아이디어 생성과 아키텍처 결정","전략적 계획과 기술 추천","구조화된 설계와 개발 지원","AI/ML 프로젝트 설계 지원","웹 애플리케이션과 모바일 프로젝트 설계 지원"],"es":["Ideación estructurada para proyectos de AI/ML","Análisis sistemático de conceptos iniciales","Toma de decisiones arquitectónicas para aplicaciones web y móviles","Planificación estratégica para proyectos de inteligencia artificial","Recomendaciones de tecnologías para proyectos de Machine Learning"],"fr":["Idéation structurée pour les projets d''IA/ML","Analyse systématique des concepts initiaux","Prise de décision architecturale pour les applications web et mobiles","Planification stratégique pour les projets d''intelligence artificielle","Recommandations de technologies pour les projets de Machine Learning"],"de":["Strukturierte Ideenfindung für KI/ML-Projekte","Systematische Analyse von anfänglichen Konzepten","Architektonische Entscheidungsfindung für Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte","Strategische Planung für KI-Projekte","Technologie-Empfehlungen für Machine-Learning-Projekte"],"pt":["Análise sistemática de conceitos iniciais de projeto","Recomendações de tecnologia para agentes de IA e aplicações web","Criação de designs abrangentes para projetos de AI/ML","Planejamento estratégico para projetos de tecnologia","Tomada de decisões arquitetônicas para projetos de software"],"ru":["Системный анализ первоначальных концепций проекта","Рекомендации по технологиям для ИИ Агентов и веб-приложений","Создание комплексных дизайнов для проектов ИИ/МЛ","Стратегическое планирование для проектов технологий","Архитектурное решение для проектов программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التحليل المنتظم للمفاهيم الأولية للمشروع","توصيات التكنولوجيا للوكلاء الذكية وتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء تصاميم شاملة لمشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي/ال학習 الآلي","التخطيط الاستراتيجي لمشاريع التكنولوجيا","اتخاذ القرارات المعمارية لمشاريع البرمجيات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use project-designer","project-designer alternative","project-designer setup guide","what is project-designer","project-designer vs competing design tools","project-designer install for AI agents","project-designer for web application design","project-designer features and benefits","project-designer for mobile project planning","getting started with project-designer"],"zh":["Project Designer","AI 项目设计","结构化设计","技术推荐","系统分析","特性增强","AI 项目架构","Web 应用程序设计","移动项目设计"],"ja":["Project Designer","AIエージェント","構造化設計","技術勧告","システム分析","特性強化","AIプロジェクト設計","Webアプリケーションデザイン","モバイルプロジェクト設計"],"ko":["Project Designer","AI 프로젝트 설계","체계적인 설계","기술 추천","시스템 분석","특성 강화","AI 프로젝트 아키텍처","웹 애플리케이션 설계","모바일 프로젝트 설계"],"es":["diseñador de proyectos","agentes de inteligencia artificial","proyectos de AI/ML","aplicaciones web y móviles","análisis sistemático","toma de decisiones arquitectónicas","planificación estratégica","recomendaciones de tecnologías"],"fr":["concepteur de projets","agents d''intelligence artificielle","projets d''IA/ML","applications web et mobiles","analyse systématique","prise de décision architecturale","planification stratégique","recommandations de technologies"],"de":["Projekt-Designer","KI-Agents","KI/ML-Projekte","Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte","systematische Analyse","architektonische Entscheidungsfindung","strategische Planung","Technologie-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Project Designer","agentes de IA","aplicações web","design de projeto","análise sistemática","recomendações de tecnologia","projetos de AI/ML","planejamento estratégico","tomada de decisões arquitetônicas"],"ru":["Project Designer","ИИ Агенты","веб-приложения","проектный дизайн","системный анализ","рекомендации по технологиям","проекты ИИ/МЛ","стратегическое планирование","архитектурное решение"],"ar":["مصمم المشروع","الوكلاء الذكية","تطبيقات الويب","تصميم المشروع","التحليل المنتظم","توصيات التكنولوجيا","مشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي/ال학습 الآلي","التخطيط الاستراتيجي","اتخاذ القرارات المعمارية"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"Digital-FTE","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.299Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-designer","description":"Comprehensive project design and ideation skill for AI/ML and web/mobile applications. Use when users present initial project ideas that need enhancement, architectural guidance, technology stack recommendations, feature expansion, or implementation strategy. Triggers include requests like help me design a [project type], I want to build [concept] but need to flesh out the idea, what features should I add to [project], recommend a tech stack for [idea], or enhance my project concept. Provides structured design thinking, architectural patterns, feature frameworks, and technology recommendations through progressive disclosure of specialized reference materials.","bodyPreview":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions","body":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Extract Core Information**:\n   - Project type (AI/ML agent, web app, mobile app)\n   - Primary problem being solved\n   - Target users or personas\n   - Key constraints (budget, timeline, team size, technical expertise)\n\n2. **Identify Gaps**:\n   - Missing requirements or specifications\n   - Unclear objectives or success criteria\n   - Undefined user needs\n\n3. **Ask Clarifying Questions**:\n   Use the AskUserQuestion tool when:\n   - Project scope is ambiguous\n   - Multiple architectural approaches are viable\n   - Technical requirements are unclear\n   - User needs are not fully specified\n\n### Phase 2: Architecture and Technology Guidance\n\n**Objective**: Recommend appropriate architectural patterns and technology stacks based on project requirements.\n\n**Reference Materials**: Load based on project type and needs:\n- **`references/ai-ml-patterns.md`**: For AI/ML agents, RAG systems, conversational AI, ML pipelines\n- **`references/web-app-patterns.md`**: For web/mobile applications, API design, full-stack systems\n- **`references/tech-stack-matrix.md`**: For technology selection across all project types\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Identify project type and match to established architectural patterns\n2. Recommend technology stack based on team expertise, budget, scalability needs\n3. Explain architectural decisions with clear rationale and trade-offs\n\n### Phase 3: Feature Discovery and Enhancement\n\n**Objective**: Expand the initial concept with comprehensive, prioritized features.\n\n**Reference Material**: `references/feature-frameworks.md`\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Apply feature discovery methods (Jobs-to-be-Done, User Story Mapping, Feature Analogies)\n2. Categorize features: Must-Have (MVP), Should-Have (Post-MVP), Could-Have (Future)\n3. Apply prioritization framework (RICE, ICE, Kano model)\n4. Consider enhancement dimensions: capability, UX, integration, intelligence\n\n### Phase 4: Structured Documentation\n\n**Objective**: Produce comprehensive project documentation using standardized templates.\n\n**Asset Templates**: Use appropriate templates based on user needs:\n- **`assets/templates/project-brief.md`**: Complete project specification\n- **`assets/templates/architecture-blueprint.md`**: Detailed technical architecture\n- **`assets/templates/feature-roadmap.md`**: Prioritized feature timeline\n\n### Phase 5: Iterative Refinement\n\n**Objective**: Refine the design based on user feedback and emerging requirements.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Present recommendations clearly with critical decisions highlighted\n2. Respond to user feedback and adjust recommendations\n3. Provide detailed explanations of recommendations\n4. Start high-level, drill down into specifics as needed\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: New Project Ideation\nUser presents initial idea → Understand requirements → Recommend architecture/stack → Enhance features → Generate project-brief.md\n\n### Pattern 2: Existing Project Enhancement\nUser has working system → Understand current state → Apply feature frameworks → Prioritize enhancements → Generate feature-roadmap.md\n\n### Pattern 3: Technology Stack Consultation\nUser needs tech guidance → Clarify requirements → Consult tech-stack-matrix.md → Recommend stack with rationale\n\n### Pattern 4: Architecture Design\nUser needs technical design → Gather requirements → Recommend pattern → Define components → Generate architecture-blueprint.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Communication**:\n- Follow workflow phases sequentially\n- Use progressive disclosure (high-level first, details when needed)\n- Provide concrete, implementable recommendations\n\n**Technical Recommendations**:\n- Balance pragmatism with best practices\n- Consider team capabilities and constraints\n- Provide primary recommendation + alternatives with trade-offs\n\n**Feature Design**:\n- Ground features in user problems and needs\n- Define clear MVP scope\n- Use quantitative prioritization frameworks\n\n## Reference Material Usage\n\n**Load references/ai-ml-patterns.md when**: AI agents, RAG systems, ML pipelines, NLP/CV applications\n\n**Load references/web-app-patterns.md when**: Web/mobile apps, API design, authentication, database patterns\n\n**Load references/tech-stack-matrix.md when**: Technology selection, team/budget considerations, scalability needs\n\n**Load references/feature-frameworks.md when**: Feature ideation, prioritization, user-centric design, roadmap planning\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Suggest over-engineered solutions for simple problems\n- Ignore constraints (budget, timeline, expertise)\n- Skip Phase 1 understanding to rush to recommendations\n- Load all references unnecessarily\n- Make assumptions without clarifying\n\n**Do**:\n- Ask clarifying questions when unclear\n- Tailor recommendations to specific context\n- Provide rationale for recommendations\n- Use reference materials to support recommendations\n- Balance comprehensiveness with actionability\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:24.571Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI/ML Agents and Developer Agents needing structured project planning and architectural decision-making capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化项目规划和架构决策能力的AI/ML代理和开发者代理。","ja":"AI/MLエージェントと開発者エージェントが構造化されたプロジェクト計画とアーキテクチャの意思決定能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 계획과 아키텍처 의사 결정 능력이 필요한 AI/ML 에이전트와 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA/ML y agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una planificación de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de toma de decisiones arquitectónicas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA/ML et les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une planification de projet structurée et de capacités de prise de décision architecturale.","de":"Perfekt für AI/ML-Agents und Developer-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektplanung und architektonische Entscheidungskompetenzen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA/ML e Agentes de Desenvolvedores que precisam de planejamento de projetos estruturados e capacidades de tomada de decisões arquitetônicas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ/МЛ и агентов разработчиков, которым необходимы структурированное планирование проектов и возможности принятия архитектурных решений.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإصطناعيين / التعلم الآلي والوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط مشروع منظم وقدرات اتخاذ القرارات المعمارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform initial project concepts into comprehensive designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations, utilizing strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","zh":"赋予代理能够通过系统分析、功能增强和技术推荐将初始项目概念转化为综合设计，利用AI/ML代理、Web应用程序和移动项目的战略规划。","ja":"エージェントが初期のプロジェクトコンセプトを包括的な設計に変換できるようにし、システム分析、機能強化、技術推奨を使用して、AI/MLエージェント、Webアプリケーション、モバイルプロジェクトの戦略的計画を行います。","ko":"초기 프로젝트 개념을 포괄적인 디자인으로 변환할 수 있는 에이전트를赋予하고, 시스템 분석, 기능 향상, 기술 추천을 사용하여 AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션, 모바일 프로젝트의 전략적 계획을 수립합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar los conceptos de proyecto iniciales en diseños integrales a través del análisis sistemático, la mejora de funciones y las recomendaciones tecnológicas, utilizando la planificación estratégica para agentes de IA/ML, aplicaciones web y proyectos móviles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les concepts de projet initiaux en conceptions globales grâce à l''analyse systématique, l''amélioration des fonctionnalités et les recommandations technologiques, en utilisant la planification stratégique pour les agents IA/ML, les applications Web et les projets mobiles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die anfänglichen ProjektKonzepte in umfassende Entwürfe durch systematische Analyse, Funktionsverbesserung und Technologieempfehlungen zu verwandeln, indem sie strategische Planung für AI/ML-Agents, Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar conceitos iniciais de projetos em designs abrangentes por meio de análise sistemática, melhoria de recursos e recomendações de tecnologia, utilizando planejamento estratégico para agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e projetos móveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать первоначальные проектные концепции в комплексные дизайны посредством системного анализа, улучшения функций и технологических рекомендаций, используя стратегическое планирование для агентов ИИ/МЛ, веб-приложений и мобильных проектов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتحويل المفاهيم الأولية للمشروع إلى تصاميم شاملة من خلال التحليل المنهجي وتحسين الميزات والتوصيات التكنولوجية، باستخدام التخطيط الاستراتيجي للوكلاء الإصطناعيين / التعلم الآلي والتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project design workflows","Generating well-architected designs for web applications","Creating strategic plans for AI/ML agent integration"],"zh":["自动化项目设计工作流程","为Web应用程序生成良好架构的设计","为AI/ML代理集成创建战略计划"],"ja":["プロジェクト設計ワークフローの自動化","Webアプリケーション用の良好なアーキテクチャ設計の生成","AI/MLエージェント統合の戦略計画の作成"],"ko":["프로젝트 디자인 워크플로의 자동화","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 잘 구조화된 디자인 생성","AI/ML 에이전트 통합을 위한 전략 계획 수립"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de diseño de proyectos","Generación de diseños bien arquitectados para aplicaciones web","Creación de planes estratégicos para la integración de agentes de IA/ML"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de conception de projet","Génération de conceptions bien architecturées pour les applications Web","Création de plans stratégiques pour l''intégration d''agents IA/ML"],"de":["Automatisierung von Projektdesign-Workflows","Erzeugung von gut architektierten Designs für Webanwendungen","Erstellung von strategischen Plänen für die Integration von AI/ML-Agents"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de design de projetos","Gerar designs bem arquitetados para aplicações web","Criar planos estratégicos para integração de agentes de IA/ML"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы проектирования","Генерировать хорошо спроектированные дизайны для веб-приложений","Создавать стратегические планы для интеграции агентов ИИ/МЛ"],"ar":["توفير آلي لتدفقات عمل تصميم المشروع","إنشاء تصاميم معمارية جيدة للتطبيقات الويب","خلق خطط استراتيجية لتكامل الوكلاء الإصطناعيين / التعلم الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thorough understanding of project goals and constraints","Limited to AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects"],"zh":["需要彻底了解项目目标和约束","仅限AI/ML代理、Web应用程序和移动项目"],"ja":["プロジェクトの目標と制約を包括的に理解する必要","AI/MLエージェント、Webアプリケーション、モバイルプロジェクトに限定"],"ko":["프로젝트 목표와 제약 조건을 철저히 이해해야 함","AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션, 모바일 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión exhaustiva de los objetivos y restricciones del proyecto","Limitado a agentes de IA/ML, aplicaciones web y proyectos móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension approfondie des objectifs et des contraintes du projet","Limité aux agents IA/ML, aux applications Web et aux projets mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt ein gründliches Verständnis der Projektziele und -beschränkungen","Begrenzt auf AI/ML-Agents, Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte"],"pt":["Requer uma compreensão aprofundada dos objetivos e restrições do projeto","Limitado a agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e projetos móveis"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания целей и ограничений проекта","Ограничен агентами ИИ/МЛ, веб-приложениями и мобильными проектами"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا عميقًا لأهداف ومحددات المشروع","محدود بالوكلاء الإصطناعيين / التعلم الآلي والتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"be9afe077fb8de8e86bf0353270766ce89e79dc6af018df8236f47f7e29b8d5b","qualityScore":44}');
