rojects using a next website template.","zh":"Find Bugs是一种AI驱动的代码审查工具，用于识别安全漏洞和代码质量问题","ja":"Find Bugsは、セキュリティ脆弱性とコード品質の問題を特定するためのAI駆動のコードレビューツールです","ko":"Find Bugs는 보안 취약점 및 코드 品質 문제를 식별하는 AI 기반 코드 검토 도구입니다","es":"Find-bugs es una herramienta de revisión de código que identifica bugs y vulnerabilidades","fr":"Find-bugs est un outil d''examen de code qui identifie les bugs et les vulnérabilités","de":"Find-bugs ist ein Code-Überprüfungstool, das Fehler und Sicherheitslücken erkennt","pt":"O Find-Bugs é uma ferramenta de análise de código que identifica bugs e problemas de qualidade de código em projetos Next com TypeScript","ru":"ИИ Агенты Find-Bugs - это инструмент анализа кода, который выявляет ошибки и проблемы качества кода в проектах Next с TypeScript","ar":"أداة العثور على الأخطاء هي أداة تحليل الكود التي تعرف الأخطاء ومشاكل جودة الكود في المشاريع التالية مع TypeScript"},"features":{"en":["Runs `git diff master...HEAD` to get the full diff of changes","Identifies and lists all user inputs, including request params, headers, body, and URL components","Maps attack surfaces for each changed file","Reviews changes on the branch for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues","Supports TypeScript projects with a next website template"],"zh":["使用Git Diff获取完整的代码差异","识别和列出所有用户输入","支持TypeScript代码审查","攻击面映射以识别安全漏洞","代码质量问题检测"],"ja":["Git Diffを使用して完全なコードの差異を取得","すべてのユーザー入力を識別してリストする","TypeScriptコードのレビューをサポート","攻撃面のマッピングを使用してセキュリティ脆弱性を特定","コード品質の問題を検出"],"ko":["Git Diff를 사용하여 전체 코드의 차이를 가져옴","모든 사용자 입력을 식별하고 목록화","TypeScript 코드 검토 지원","attack surface mapping을 사용하여 보안 취약점 식별","코드 품질 문제 감지"],"es":["Revisión de cambios en el código con git diff","Identificación de superficies de ataque en cada archivo modificado","Análisis de entradas de usuario para detectar vulnerabilidades","Lista de archivos modificados para una revisión exhaustiva","Detección de problemas de calidad en el código"],"fr":["Examen des modifications du code avec git diff","Identification des surfaces d''attaque dans chaque fichier modifié","Analyse des entrées utilisateur pour détecter les vulnérabilités","Liste des fichiers modifiés pour un examen exhaustif","Détection des problèmes de qualité dans le code"],"de":["Überprüfung von Code-Änderungen mit git diff","Identifizierung von Angriffsoberflächen in jedem geänderten Datei","Analyse von Benutzereingaben zur Erkennung von Sicherheitslücken","Liste der geänderten Dateien für eine gründliche Überprüfung","Erkennung von Qualitätsproblemen im Code"],"pt":["Análise de alterações no código com `git diff master...HEAD`","Listagem de todos os arquivos modificados","Identificação de entradas de usuário (parâmetros de solicitação, cabeçalhos, corpo, componentes de URL)","Mapeamento de superfície de ataque","Análise de qualidade de código","Integração com projetos Next e TypeScript"],"ru":["Анализ изменений в коде с помощью `git diff master...HEAD`","Перечисление всех измененных файлов","Выявление пользовательских входных данных (параметров запроса, заголовков, тела, компонентов URL)","Маппинг поверхности атаки","Анализ качества кода","Интеграция с проектами Next и TypeScript"],"ar":["تحليل التغييرات في الكود باستخدام `git diff master...HEAD`","قائمة بجميع الملفات المعدلة","تحديد إدخالات المستخدم (محددات الطلب، الرؤوس، الجسم، مكونات URL)","خريطة سطح الهجوم","تحليل جودة الكود","التكامل مع المشاريع التالية و TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use find-bugs","find-bugs alternative","find-bugs setup guide","what is find-bugs","find-bugs vs code review tools","find-bugs install for TypeScript projects"],"zh":["Find Bugs","代码审查","Git Diff","TypeScript","安全漏洞","代码质量","AI驱动","代码审查工具"],"ja":["Find Bugs","コードレビュー","Git Diff","TypeScript","セキュリティ脆弱性","コード品質","AI駆動","コードレビューツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Find Bugs","코드 검토","Git Diff","TypeScript","보안 취약점","코드 품질","AI 기반","코드 검토 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["find-bugs","seguridad del código","detección de bugs","vulnerabilidades de seguridad","calidad del código","git diff","análisis de código","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["find-bugs","sécurité du code","détection de bugs","vulnérabilités de sécurité","qualité du code","git diff","analyse de code","outils de développement"],"de":["find-bugs","Code-Sicherheit","Fehlererkennung","Sicherheitslücken","Code-Qualität","git diff","Code-Analyse","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Find-Bugs","análise de código","bugs","vulnerabilidades de segurança","problemas de qualidade de código","Next","TypeScript","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты Find-Bugs","анализ кода","ошибки","уязвимости безопасности","проблемы качества кода","Next","TypeScript","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أداة العثور على الأخطاء","تحليل الكود","أخطاء","أخطاء أمان","مشاكل جودة الكود","التالي","TypeScript","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"JFEspanolito","repo":"Template_FrontEnd_NextJS_JF","repoPath":"JFEspanolito/Template_FrontEnd_NextJS_JF","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.351Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"find-bugs","description":"Find bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues in local branch changes. Use when asked to review changes, find bugs, security review, or audit code on the current branch.","bodyPreview":"# Find Bugs\n\nReview changes on this branch for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues.\n\n## Phase 1: Complete Input Gathering\n\n1. Get the FULL diff: `git diff master...HEAD`\n2. If output is truncated, read each changed file individually until you have seen every changed line\n3. List all files modified in this branch before proceeding\n\n## Phase 2: Attack Surface Mapping\n\nFor each changed file, identify and list:\n\n* All user inputs (request params, headers, body, URL components)\n*","body":"# Find Bugs\n\nReview changes on this branch for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues.\n\n## Phase 1: Complete Input Gathering\n\n1. Get the FULL diff: `git diff master...HEAD`\n2. If output is truncated, read each changed file individually until you have seen every changed line\n3. List all files modified in this branch before proceeding\n\n## Phase 2: Attack Surface Mapping\n\nFor each changed file, identify and list:\n\n* All user inputs (request params, headers, body, URL components)\n* All database queries\n* All authentication/authorization checks\n* All session/state operations\n* All external calls\n* All cryptographic operations\n\n## Phase 3: Security Checklist (check EVERY item for EVERY file)\n\n* [ ] **Injection**: SQL, command, template, header injection\n* [ ] **XSS**: All outputs in templates properly escaped?\n* [ ] **Authentication**: Auth checks on all protected operations?\n* [ ] **Authorization/IDOR**: Access control verified, not just auth?\n* [ ] **CSRF**: State-changing operations protected?\n* [ ] **Race conditions**: TOCTOU in any read-then-write patterns?\n* [ ] **Session**: Fixation, expiration, secure flags?\n* [ ] **Cryptography**: Secure random, proper algorithms, no secrets in logs?\n* [ ] **Information disclosure**: Error messages, logs, timing attacks?\n* [ ] **DoS**: Unbounded operations, missing rate limits, resource exhaustion?\n* [ ] **Business logic**: Edge cases, state machine violations, numeric overflow?\n\n## Phase 4: Verification\n\nFor each potential issue:\n\n* Check if it''s already handled elsewhere in the changed code\n* Search for existing tests covering the scenario\n* Read surrounding context to verify the issue is real\n\n## Phase 5: Pre-Conclusion Audit\n\nBefore finalizing, you MUST:\n\n1. List every file you reviewed and confirm you read it completely\n2. List every checklist item and note whether you found issues or confirmed it''s clean\n3. List any areas you could NOT fully verify and why\n4. Only then provide your final findings\n\n## Output Format\n\n**Prioritize**: security vulnerabilities > bugs > code quality\n\n**Skip**: stylistic/formatting issues\n\nFor each issue:\n\n* **File:Line** - Brief description\n* **Severity**: Critical/High/Medium/Low\n* **Problem**: What''s wrong\n* **Evidence**: Why this is real (not already fixed, no existing test, etc.)\n* **Fix**: Concrete suggestion\n* **References**: OWASP, RFCs, or other standards if applicable\n\nIf you find nothing significant, say so - don''t invent issues.\n\nDo not make changes - just report findings. I''ll decide what to address.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:50.336Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced git diff analysis and attack surface mapping capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 git diff 分析和攻击表面映射能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが高度な git diff 分析および攻撃表面マッピング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 git diff 분석 및 공격 표면 매핑 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan un análisis avanzado de git diff y capacidades de mapeo de superficie de ataque.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant une analyse avancée de git diff et des capacités de cartographie de surface d''attaque.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine erweiterte git diff-Analyse und Angriffsflächen-Mapping-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise avançada de git diff e capacidades de mapeamento de superfície de ataque.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимы расширенные возможности анализа git diff и отображения поверхности атаки.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل مراجعة الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لgit diff وقدرات رسم سطوح الهجوم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review changes on a branch for bugs, security vulnerabilities, and code quality issues using git diff and attack surface mapping, providing comprehensive insights into user inputs and potential vulnerabilities.","zh":"赋予代理审查分支的更改以发现 bug、安全漏洞和代码质量问题的能力，使用 git diff 和攻击表面映射，提供对用户输入和潜在漏洞的全面见解。","ja":"エージェントがブランチの変更をレビューしてバグ、セキュリティ脆弱性、およびコード品質の問題を特定する機能を付与し、git diffおよび攻撃表面マッピングを使用して、ユーザー入力および潜在的な脆弱性に関する包括的な洞察を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 브랜치의 변경 사항을 검토하여 버그, 보안 취약점 및 코드 품질 문제를 식별할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, git diff 및 공격 표면 매핑을 사용하여 사용자 입력 및 잠재적 취약성에 대한 포괄적인 통찰력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar los cambios en una rama para errores, vulnerabilidades de seguridad y problemas de calidad del código utilizando git diff y mapeo de superficie de ataque, proporcionando información completa sobre las entradas de usuario y las posibles vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser les modifications sur une branche pour les bogues, les vulnérabilités de sécurité et les problèmes de qualité de code en utilisant git diff et la cartographie de surface d''attaque, fournissant des informations complètes sur les entrées utilisateur et les vulnérabilités potentielles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Änderungen in einem Branch auf Fehler, Sicherheitslücken und Codequalitätsprobleme zu überprüfen, indem sie git diff und Angriffsflächen-Mapping verwenden, und bietet umfassende Einblicke in Benutzereingaben und potenzielle Sicherheitslücken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar alterações em um branch para bugs, vulnerabilidades de segurança e problemas de qualidade de código usando git diff e mapeamento de superfície de ataque, fornecendo insights abrangentes sobre entradas de usuário e possíveis vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять изменения в ветке на наличие ошибок, уязвимостей безопасности и проблем качества кода с помощью git diff и отображения поверхности атаки, обеспечивая всесторонний анализ пользовательских входных данных и потенциальных уязвимостей.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على مراجعة التغييرات على الفرع لbugs وثغرات أمنية ومشاكل جودة الشفرة باستخدام git diff و رسم سطوح الهجوم، مع تقديم رؤى شاملة حول مدخلات المستخدم والثغرات المحتملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for security vulnerabilities","Identifying potential bugs in changed files using git diff","Mapping attack surfaces for user inputs and request parameters"],"zh":["自动化代码审查以发现安全漏洞","使用 git diff 识别更改文件中的潜在 bug","映射用户输入和请求参数的攻击表面"],"ja":["セキュリティ脆弱性を特定するためのコードレビューの自動化","git diff を使用して変更されたファイル内の潜在的なバグを特定する","ユーザー入力およびリクエストパラメータの攻撃表面をマッピングする"],"ko":["보안 취약성을 발견하기 위한 코드 리뷰 자동화","git diff를 사용하여 변경된 파일에서 잠재적인 버그 식별","사용자 입력 및 요청 매개 변수의 공격 표면 매핑"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de código para vulnerabilidades de seguridad","Identificación de errores potenciales en archivos modificados utilizando git diff","Mapeo de superficies de ataque para entradas de usuario y parámetros de solicitud"],"fr":["Automatisation des revues de code pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité","Identification des bogues potentiels dans les fichiers modifiés à l''aide de git diff","Cartographie des surfaces d''attaque pour les entrées utilisateur et les paramètres de requête"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Reviews für Sicherheitslücken","Identifizierung von potenziellen Fehlern in geänderten Dateien unter Verwendung von git diff","Mappen von Angriffsflächen für Benutzereingaben und Anfrageparameter"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para vulnerabilidades de segurança","Identificar bugs potenciais em arquivos alterados usando git diff","Mapear superfícies de ataque para entradas de usuário e parâmetros de solicitação"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверки кода на наличие уязвимостей безопасности","Определение потенциальных ошибок в измененных файлах с помощью git diff","Отображение поверхностей атаки для пользовательских входных данных и параметров запроса"],"ar":["توسيع مراجعة الشفرة للتأكد من ثغرات أمنية","تحديد الأخطاء المحتملة في الملفات المعدلة باستخدام git diff","رسم سطوح الهجوم لمدخلات المستخدم ومعلمات الطلب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git repository access","Limited to reviewing changes on a single branch","May require manual review of truncated git diff outputs"],"zh":["需要 git 存储库访问权限","仅限于单个分支的更改审查","可能需要手动审查截断的 git diff 输出"],"ja":["git リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","単一のブランチでの変更のレビューのみ",